@startuml
title "AI图像识别与智能标签"用例交互顺序图
actor "机主/调度器" as Trigger
boundary "主界面\nMainView" as MainView
control "AI服务控制器\nAIServiceControl" as AICtrl
control "数据库控制器\nDatabaseManagerControl" as DBCtrl
boundary "外部AI服务\nOpenAICompatibleAPI" as API
entity "图片实体\nImageFile" as ImageFile
entity "图像标签\nImageTag" as ImageTag

Trigger -> MainView : 1. 启动扫描或补打AI标签
MainView -> AICtrl : 2. analyzePendingImages(directory)
AICtrl -> DBCtrl : 3. queryPendingImages(directory)
DBCtrl --> AICtrl : 4. 返回待识别图片列表
loop 每一张待识别图片
    AICtrl -> ImageFile : 5. readImageBytes()
    ImageFile --> AICtrl : 6. 返回图片内容
    AICtrl -> API : 7. HTTP POST image + prompt
    API --> AICtrl : 8. 返回JSON识别结果
    AICtrl -> ImageTag : 9. parseAndRankTags(result)
    ImageTag --> AICtrl : 10. 返回标签集合
    AICtrl -> DBCtrl : 11. saveTagsAndAnalysis(image, tags)
    DBCtrl --> AICtrl : 12. 保存成功
end
AICtrl --> MainView : 13. reportProgressAndSummary()
MainView --> Trigger : 14. 刷新标签、搜索和扫描进度
@enduml
